<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskAvoidance> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#Concept> .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskAvoidance> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "07/09/2020" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskAvoidance> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Rob" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskAvoidance> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Part 1/ISO 31000:2009" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskAvoidance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Informed decision not to be involved in, or to withdraw from, an activity in order not to be exposed to a particular risk. Risk avoidance may increase the significance of other risks or may lead to the loss of opportunities for gain." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskAvoidance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Avoidance" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskAvoidance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#definition> "Informed decision not to be involved in, or to withdraw from, an activity in order not to be exposed to a particular risk. Risk avoidance may increase the significance of other risks or may lead to the loss of opportunities for gain." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskAvoidance> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos#prefLabel> "Risk Avoidance" .
