<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskProfile> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "HSE Part 1/ISO 31000:2009" .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A risk profile is a written description of a set of risks. A risk profile can include the risks that the entire organisation must manage or only those that a particular function or part of the organisation must address. (In the HSE, a services risk profile is set out in their risk register)." .
<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskProfile> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Risk Profile" .
