<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#RiskRe-Rating> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "With the completion of some or all of the actions the level of risk (the rating) may be reassessed in order to consider whether its likelihood or impact score has reduced." .
