<https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKHealthTerminology#Vigilance> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Being alert to the potential of harm occurring within the workplace. The heightened sense of awareness that you need to adopt and engender within the workplace to ensure ongoing safety in the delivery of services." .
